%% State 02 — ReviewSession lifecycle
%% Evidence status: Implemented.
%% Updated 2026-07-27 (code-verified).
%% Scope: Stable ReviewSession.status values only; manager/peer work proceeds in parallel.

stateDiagram-v2
direction LR
    [*] --> pending : openSession / seed reviewer assignments
    pending --> in_progress : submitFirstReview / retain submitted review
    in_progress --> in_progress : submitAdditionalReview [quorum not met] / update counts
    in_progress --> completed : submitReview [manager and peer quorum met] / close collection
    completed --> disputed : disputeReview [reason supplied] / create review_disputes case
    completed --> [*] : confirmReview / retain confirmed outcome
    disputed --> [*] : resolveDispute / retain governed resolution

    note right of in_progress
        Manager and peer reviews are concurrent work,
        not separate ReviewSession states.
        required_peer_reviews defaults to 2.
    end note

    note right of completed
        Confirmation triggers reviewee and reviewer
        recalculation through review:confirmed.
        Dispute resolution remains human-authoritative.
    end note

